{"name":"The Bluff","hex":"#ffc8c2","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bluff","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of bluffing; a false expression of the strength of one’s position in order to intimidate or deceive; braggadocio.","An attempt to represent oneself as holding a stronger hand than one actually does."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make a bluff; to give the impression that one’s hand is stronger than it is.","To frighten, deter, or deceive with a false show of strength or confidence; to give a false impression of strength or temerity in order to intimidate or gain some advantage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bluff"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bluff, Queensland","blocks":[{"text":"Bluff is a rural town and locality in the Central Highlands Region, Queensland, Australia. In the 2021 census, the locality of Bluff had a population of 324 people."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Bluff6.jpg/330px-Bluff6.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bluff%2C_Queensland","wikidata":"Q4930626"},{"title":"The Bluff, Queensland (Ipswich)","blocks":[{"text":"The Bluff is a rural locality in the City of Ipswich, Queensland, Australia. In the 2021 census, The Bluff had a population of 53 people."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bluff%2C_Queensland_(Ipswich)","wikidata":"Q7718904"},{"title":"The Bluff (film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Bluff is a 2026 swashbuckler action thriller film directed by Frank E. Flowers, written by Flowers and Joe Ballarini, and starring Priyanka Chopra, Karl Urban, Ismael Cruz Córdova, Safia Oakley-Green and Temuera Morrison. In the 19th century, a retired Caribbean pirate living a tranquil life on a remote island must protect her family from a band of vicious buccaneers led by an old enemy who arrive on her island to claim the bounty on her head. It is produced by AGBO, Cinestar Pictures, and Purple Pebble Pictures. It was released on Amazon Prime Video on February 25, 2026."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/17/The_Bluff_2026_poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bluff_(film)","wikidata":"Q126391409"},{"title":"The Bluff (album)","blocks":[{"text":"The Bluff is an album by the American musician Sarah Dougher, released in 2001. Dougher supported it with North American and Australian tours."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7a/Sarah_Dougher_-_The_Bluff.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bluff_(album)","wikidata":"Q126679045"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Bluff4.jpg/500px-Bluff4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Bluff4.jpg/1280px-Bluff4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Bluff4.jpg/500px-Bluff4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bluff Hotel, 2017","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABluff4.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Bluff7.jpg/500px-Bluff7.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Bluff7.jpg/1280px-Bluff7.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Bluff7.jpg/500px-Bluff7.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bluff State School, 2017","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABluff7.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wiki